e_name": "05_Faces_Selector_2560x1440.png", "id": "1288337783335827", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831299_1288337786669160_4475558771986816353_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=69ZjV7CUangQ7kNvwGbb_we&_nc_oc=Adpy4oref7eGKPs-1KtPvnp9o9Z5EOrPU9ZpsIgcwho3GoW7NJf0KX2V2CU8sfRag2U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQON9S34_bseSc8RArxGCRpwo-1akoAUpD3f_odmX2WcFQ&oe=6AC8E7AD"}, {"file_name": "01_Barker_Neutral_2560x1440.png", "id": "1821110108888468", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830441_1821110112221801_8561623093088699699_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=03Kg20dREe0Q7kNvwEDvJ5W&_nc_oc=Adpvje9lxcrB2W_0PfndTNeE31DnoemeLIlRO3oLMeaSjVTjdBDBx5xlKTON6iTb2hc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNfcRLpDHpg4mOfEG2qA-EG5VM87vnbMETfiOIpxwCFRQ&oe=6AC9164F"}, {"file_name": "03_Barker_Action_2560x1440.png", "id": "2620587385039026", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/585799753_2620587388372359_8557321908904764527_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=B8omcOnwexwQ7kNvwE6WurC&_nc_oc=AdrKUKwhUVIUedj6m51XAmLqSMwf4t1ml_KTKeTu-vIQJ_Klhei2gZFvkHCqzthaa8E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOFryteNqgoI4bpy7E1tVioAQaE31u6MwV0jIWMJdn_aQ&oe=6AC919FC"}, {"file_name": "02_Flexer_Neutral_2560x1440.png", "id": "3167831576755462", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831299_3167831580088795_7645227145100028470_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QpDzR4lfqZsQ7kNvwFFJuzI&_nc_oc=Adr1SMTH21RmLdh1In7ZOJ84OIGeopv9JfnBCCk7M0CgR4EbhDGH-zxed8kvoSoIME0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMq1rSSPWwWu0rhcDJHQmmLAKpdwNxV5u--AlB9zPl7Gw&oe=6AC8EBCC"}, {"file_name": "04_Flexer_Action_2560x1440.png", "id": "2184872072072152", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831299_2184872075405485_4008272742366392584_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-lWeziIsr-4Q7kNvwHYy2hm&_nc_oc=AdqFwi9irevGlNm9W9DnoekI9iZ5fWB-LvqPV9QdwooDM7nKqgt78MWblwlXcLHDQVo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOJmYWDuhX0yBCNC-y8e1jYzjnBKqVkLKdbbMi4Jlpt_A&oe=6AC91513"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Punchable Face", "keywords": ["boxing", "punching", "arcade", "stress", "fitness"], "long_description": "Sometimes you just want to punch a face.\n\n**Punchable Face** is a simple VR stress toy built around one idea: choose an irritating character, step into their world, and go to town.\n\n## Choose Your Face\n\n### The Barker\nA grinning carnival loudmouth waiting for you under the lights.\n\n### The Flexer\nA smug car-meet regular surrounded by modified cars and nighttime parking-lot lights.\n\n## Hit Harder\n\nEvery valid punch is measured using your controller speed and converted into an **Impact Score from 100 to 999**.\n\nChase your Session Best and watch each character react with movement, haptics, impact audio, facial reactions, and accumulating redness that slowly fades when you stop.\n\n## Features\n\n- Two characters with unique environments\n- Physics-based punch detection\n- Impact Score and Session Best\n- Hand-specific haptics\n- Reactive faces and visual feedback\n- Standing or seated play\n- No locomotion, rounds, health bars, or complicated progression\n\n**Pick a face. Punch it.**", "short_description": "Pick an annoying face, put on your gloves, and start swinging. Punchable Face is a simple VR stress toy with satisfying impacts, haptics, scoring, and two ridiculous characters to pummel."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.stormxr.tech/privacy-policy/punchable-face", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "StormXR LLC", "support_website_url": "https://www.stormxr.tech/contact", "website_url": "https://www.stormxr.tech/development", "category": n